### 1. CSRF 토큰 조회
GET http://localhost:8080/api/auth/csrf
Accept: application/json

> {%
    client.global.set("csrfToken", response.body.token);
    client.global.set("csrfHeader", response.body.headerName);
%}


### 2. 로그인
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json
X-XSRF-TOKEN: {{csrfToken}}

{
  "username": "testuser",
  "password": "bootertest26!@"
}


### 3. Vector Search
